WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Send the day. With confidence. Read the final report once more, then submit it.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.633
Open EOD Review. Your submitted report starts from the dashboard.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.983
Read the final report. Check the summary, completed work and carried items one last time.

00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:10.650
Submit only when it is accurate. Submit EOD sends the report to your manager.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.900
Submitted. The report is with your manager and the day is closed.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.200
Done for today. Your manager has the record. The offline demo sent nothing to a server.
